$MDESC::Type = "Capture the Flag";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Omicron Argentis VI" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Clear" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Night" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
	 "\n<f1>Map Design by: <f0> SL83 SL83@mindspring.com ICQ: 32109041" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> face each other for control of the desert planet of Omicron Argentis VI, home to a long-dead race known as the Titans.  The battle is taking place amongst the ancient ruins of this extinct people.  Each team has a great airbase set up high above the pyramid buildings.  The air bases house each teams' flag.  Grab the enemy tribe's flag and bring it back to your airbase, touching it to your own flag to capture it.  Victory will be achieved by the team that successfully captures their opponent's flag seven times.";
